      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "This article provides an overview of the resurfacing technique of dermabrasion. Preoperative consultation, perioperative medications, postoperative management, common complications, and reasonable outcome expectations are all described in detail. A description of proper technique, intraoperative equipment, and an approach to full-face procedures is also described."},
